@startuml Vista de Processos – Level 2 (US 2.2.8 – Create Vessel Visit Notification)
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor Black
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    LifeLineBorderColor Black
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantBorderColor Black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
}

participant "<<container (C4)>>\nSPA (Web UI)" as UI #87CEEB
participant "<<container (C4)>>\nPort Logistics (Backend)" as BACKEND #87CEEB

-> UI: 1: asks to create a Vessel Visit Notification (VVN)
activate UI
UI --> : 1.1: ask for required data (Vessel, ETA/ETD, cargo manifest, crew info when needed)
deactivate UI
-> UI: 2: provides VVN data (may be incomplete)
activate UI
UI -> BACKEND: 2.1: save VVN with "in progress" status
activate BACKEND
BACKEND --> UI: 2.1.1: creation confirmation
UI --> : 2.2: displays confirmation
deactivate BACKEND
deactivate UI
